A field loaded through a pointer that was not built where it is loaded: its
values are what the program stores to that field anywhere. Here the only
writer is the composite literal in the constructor, which stores a call
result. The Propagation Path starts where the value enters the writer, then
has the writer's store, the load, and the calls up to the Target.
